59
00:05:24.958 --> 00:05:26.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">أشعر بتحسن كبير.</font>

60
00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:42.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">بقي هنا.</font>

61
00:06:27.583 --> 00:06:29.583
