<font face="Comic Sans MS">أليس هذا صحيحاً؟</font>

103
00:09:58.792 --> 00:09:59.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">نعم؟</font>

104
00:09:59.292 --> 00:10:00.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">دعنا نأكل!</font>

105
00:10:00.083 --> 00:10:01.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">وقت للأكل!</font>

106
00:10:02.167 --> 00:10:03.083
